  {
   "id": "t_4e0e9015547258ab56c4",
   "sourceHash": "4e0e9015547258ab56c43a6e83ece604f668dd441a661b2b3f18590def582ec5",
   "text": "前往 Google Maps 和 Tripadvisor，查看更多患者与来访者的反馈、来访者拍摄的照片以及近期经历。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'guest feedback' rendered as 患者与来访者的反馈 and 'traveller photographs' as 来访者拍摄的照片, per the KTAHV language lock (no 'guests')."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c1f1a53c493fa0c2470f",
   "sourceHash": "c1f1a53c493fa0c2470f8ddad8dd6c8e251926baa4ac2e4e5117c084417c11ad",
   "text": "您的经历对我们很重要",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c125a984b5bb6904a90c",
   "sourceHash": "c125a984b5bb6904a90c7a903aa1857ebee0cc70df1922dc5e0259f94a48eadf",
   "text": "您曾在我们这里住过吗？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_25df085a6508d0ba577a",
   "sourceHash": "25df085a6508d0ba577a414176cec4e2a2ad99bc7f94cfc4b4758bfa9d8279d1",
   "text": "请告诉我们您满意的地方，以及我们还有哪些可以改进之处。我们欢迎每一份真实的反馈。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f3ce3fc0d023d3e40a89",
   "sourceHash": "f3ce3fc0d023d3e40a892ad29889d0ae62032656634106bbfc08496c851cbfa6",
   "text": "向 Kairali 提交反馈",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fd90a84103aa1e549a65",
   "sourceHash": "fd90a84103aa1e549a65b0f4293cdeba0c4eb3f1b1882b9343dd73b36fed0d89",
   "text": "在 Google Maps 上评价我们 ↗",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e15b06ca0eab188cdccc",
   "sourceHash": "e15b06ca0eab188cdcccf8243469d2f83f848583f6ae5c68e9503346a76aab79",
   "text": "在 Tripadvisor 上评价我们 ↗",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_77eb5e9c5aa1f0f1b546",
   "sourceHash": "77eb5e9c5aa1f0f1b54615c18d82f4fef43adf5854a6b77d60ce1df8e60f1325",
   "text": "正在计划您自己的入住？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e4232a83390f05c1d79b",
   "sourceHash": "e4232a83390f05c1d79be8a442fed41dc563969cf417181f3e0933092f530156",
   "text": "聊聊您的需求",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_58410930e246832f2ccc",
   "sourceHash": "58410930e246832f2ccc81b5119f701a61c7420e3b3df5227a739e17bb6fefc5",
   "text": "我们的患者服务团队可以解答您的问题、协助安排住宿，并帮助您迈出下一步，预约阿育吠陀医生的问诊。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b560b1c1bc37b147b61f",
   "sourceHash": "b560b1c1bc37b147b61f16cdb652078e9bddd07cfab71307bcbd77f81b051aac",
   "text": "免费医生问诊",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4b9e45a7849e3a481eb5",
   "sourceHash": "4b9e45a7849e3a481eb59e363b9fe349385fbba7c61fca4ee98ead4e5bfc466f",
